Prototype (built and run on real data; PDF, Section D)
- Fetches Agmarknet prices through the data.gov.in API: ${rows_total} records (all Assam commodities since ${assam_first_year}; the three pilot commodities in ${n_comp_states} neighbouring States).
- Harmonises ${assam_markets_raw} market names into ${assam_markets_harm} markets, builds weekly series with explicit gaps, and selects pilot series by a fixed coverage rule: ${sel_market} for ${sel_commodities}.
- Trains one global quantile model across all markets and produces price bands, Hold / Sell / Store signals and seasonal crop profiles.
- One command regenerates every number in this proposal from the data snapshot.

